nessuna parte. Senza più un posto dove fumare, il suo umore crolla — finché una giovane donna con i piercing non gli rivolge la parola: «Puoi fumare qui.»"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You","overview":"Sasaki is an overworked salaryman drifting through the corporate grind, sustained by cigarettes and the cheerful service and smile of Yamada, the clerk at his favorite supermarket. But one night after a grueling shift, he arrives late to find Yamada nowhere to be seen. With nowhere left to smoke, his spirits sink—until a pierced young woman calls out to him: “You can smoke here.”"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"社畜街道をひた走る、くたびれ中年男性の佐々木。彼のひそやかな癒しといえば、日ごろから愛煙する煙草と、行きつけのスーパーで働く女性店員 山田さんのにこやかな接客くらい。仕事に疲れたある夜、癒しを求めてスーパーに向かうが、目当ての山田さんはおらず、今どき煙草を吸える場所もなし…。意気消沈した佐々木に「ここなら吸える」と声をかけてきたのは、田山という女性だった――。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eutsFqEz7MSq48UD8GPRimXzshg.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eutsFqEz7MSq48UD8GPRimXzshg.png","language":"en","width":783,"height":287},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zinBf9ggTaUDUmhUvsuKlvmBdqZ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zinBf9ggTaUDUmhUvsuKlvmBdqZ.png","language":"en","width":1192,"height":367},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vPXfcddwA5pODCskIxBtMHoA1aK.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vPXfcddwA5pODCskIxBtMHoA1aK.png","language":"ja","width":1140,"height":352}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n8ZvVflzDKN3vXe85F1KdC5CFf9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n8ZvVflzDKN3vXe85F1KdC5CFf9.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t3VPDU7eLt55ghQDm3vQKhBcHZz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t3VPDU7eLt55ghQDm3vQKhBcHZz.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origina